      "label": "Stop and get it checked",
      "text": "Pain down a leg, numbness, weakness in a leg or foot, or numbness between your legs. If your bladder or bowel control changes, get seen the same day."
    },
    {
      "label": "Sharp pain in a move",
      "text": "Skip that move."
    }
